      "-    that one-off orchestration helpers cannot invalidate a frozen protocol or",
      "-    an already-issued entry review.",
      "+    Ad-hoc drivers are not online service modules. Scientifically material",
      "+    registration/orchestration generators must additionally be pinned in the",
      "+    v2 test registry and checked before launch/at completion. Excluding a",
      "+    driver here never exempts its generated matrix/schedules from admission.",
      "     \"\"\"",
      "     root = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent",
